-- ===== Hands positioned at 10:10:30 =====
NEW EQUI /WATCHHF_HAND_HOUR_001
DESC 'Hour hand, points to ten'
POS E -3.464 N 2.000 U 9.130
ORI Y IS N60W AND Z IS U
NEW BOX
XLEN 3.00
YLEN 8.00
ZLEN 0.06

NEW EQUI /WATCHHF_HAND_MINUTE_001
